  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "assets/images/00.png",
      "en": "Exercise",
      "cn": "第 35 篇",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/01.png",
      "en": "Everyone knows that exercise is important.",
      "cn": "大家都知道运动很重要。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/02.png",
      "en": "It makes our bodies strong.",
      "cn": "它使我们的身体强壮。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/03.png",
      "en": "When it's daytime, we should start our day with exercise.",
      "cn": "白天到来时，我们应该用运动开始一天。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/04.png",
      "en": "Children who often exercise are more active and get ill less often.",
      "cn": "经常运动的孩子更活跃，也较少生病。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/05.png",
      "en": "This means they also tend to get better marks in tests and schoolwork than those who don't exercise.",
      "cn": "这意味着他们在考试和功课中的成绩往往也比不运动的孩子更好。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/06.png",
      "en": "There are many ways to exercise.",
      "cn": "运动的方式有很多。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/07.png",
      "en": "You can walk, jog, surf, ski or play ball games.",
      "cn": "你可以散步、慢跑、冲浪、滑雪或玩球类游戏。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/08.png",
      "en": "Make sure you exercise in the following ways: You have to like what you're doing.",
      "cn": "要确保按下面的方式运动：你必须喜欢自己正在做的运动。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/09.png",
      "en": "It's best to exercise twice a week.",
      "cn": "最好每周运动两次。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/10.png",
      "en": "Thirty minutes each time is enough.",
      "cn": "每次三十分钟就够了。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/11.png",
      "en": "Too much exercise can hurt your body.",
      "cn": "运动过量会伤害身体。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/12.png",
      "en": "Besides, try all kinds of sports till you find one, two or even three that are right for you.",
      "cn": "此外，尝试各种运动，直到找到一种、两种甚至三种适合你的运动。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/13.png",
      "en": "You can exercise at fitness centres.",
      "cn": "你可以在健身中心锻炼。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/14.png",
      "en": "They have a lot of equipment there.",
      "cn": "那里有很多器材。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/15.png",
      "en": "The equipment helps strengthen your arms and legs.",
      "cn": "这些器材能帮助增强你的胳膊和腿。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/16.png",
      "en": "Some people buy equipment for their homes, but it is very expensive.",
      "cn": "有些人给家里买器材，但这很贵。",
      "unit": 3
    }
  ],
